<title>POLAND: LG Group takes majority of Petrobank.</title>
<headline>LG Group takes majority of Petrobank.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>LG Investment Holdings BV, a unit of South Korea's LG Engineering, formally announced it has acquired a 50-percent-plus-one-share stake in Polish bank Petrobank SA, the bank said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Petrobank said LG Investment had 11,128,250 shares in the bank.</p>
<p>LG Group paid 12 zlotys per share for the stake.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
